    "evidence": "The headline, instruction, prominent LAUNCH EVENT action, and side-by-side ALLOW/BLOCK result make the basic demo flow understandable without narration. However, the results do not identify the exact submitted configuration or visibly distinguish pre-launch from post-launch state, so the claimed same-event comparison is not self-proving. Dense microcopy and tiny uppercase labels reduce scanability, especially on mobile, while the mobile header hides the Composer location and Red-mode entry off-screen.",
